# Plugin folder names to copy from the static-assets image's
# /common-plugins into this site's wp-content/plugins (see Dockerfile).
# Match by unzipped folder name only, not the versioned filename used in
# containers/static-assets/pkg-mgr/common-plugins.list (e.g.
# "all-in-one-wp-migration.7.81" there vs "all-in-one-wp-migration" here) -
# WordPress plugin zips extract to a folder named after the slug, without
# the version suffix, so this works today but is an implicit contract
# between the two files.
all-in-one-wp-migration
